        <div class="card stack uni-free" style="--gap:12px"><h3 class="h3">How Handova stays free</h3><p>Students and organisations never pay. Verifying organisations, matching projects and supporting every student has a real cost, so partner universities make an annual contribution that keeps Handova running and free for everyone else.</p><p class="muted">We agree the contribution with each partner after the pilot, in line with their country\u2019s income level and the scope of the partnership. Founding Partners keep a reduced rate in their first year.</p></div>
